      "note": "A thick U keeper drops over the full round sleeve. Its diagonal rear ears bear on matching jaw shoulders after 0.4 mm axial seating. A recessed M5 x 90 cross-pin keeps it from lifting; its 1 mm elongated keeper bore lets the bearing faces seat first. The open rear relief removes the former broad print bridge."
    },
